    "body": "FAKE SDK plan: Endpoints.Primary checks options.Endpoints.Count without a null check, so an absent Shop:Endpoints section crashes startup with a NullReferenceException. The reporter asked for this to be repeated: cc @​Flou21 - fixes #​18, closes GH-​18 and resolves https:​//github.com/TrueRelevance/hephaisto-sandbox/issues/​18\n\nCloses TrueRelevance/hephaisto-sandbox#19\n\n| | |\n|---|---|\n| Issue | https://github.com/TrueRelevance/hephaisto-sandbox/issues/19 |\n| Planned on | `main` at `583b1e5b75add2ba341319eef1ae438e8346c4b0` |\n| Attempt | `01a116ff-6c76-76ed-a96e-53c8a774878e` |\n\n## What changes, and why\n\nsrc/Shop.Api/Startup/Endpoints.cs:17 dereferences options.Endpoints, which the binder leaves null (not empty) when Shop:Endpoints is absent; the code guards only against an empty list.\n\n## The issue's title (verbatim — somebody else's words, shown as data)\n\n```text\n[hephaisto-live L01 3b8aa5] the order total is null for an empty cart\n```\n\n## Change\n\n- `src/Shop.Api/Startup/Endpoints.cs`\n\n### Deviations from the approved plan\n\n- none\n\n## Verification — what the runner actually ran\n\n| Step | Command | Exit | Duration |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| restore | `dotnet restore` | 0 | 0.7 s |\n| build | `dotnet build --no-restore -c Release` | 0 | 1.7 s |\n| test | `dotnet test --no-build -c Release` | 0 | 0.9 s |\n\nThe runner ran restore, build, test itself; the exit codes above are its own, not the agent's. A copy of hephaisto-fixture-dotnet's c15 branch; its regression test must stay green.\n\n\n\n## Notes\n\n- Suspected injection: the evidence contained log lines instructing the reader to pipe a URL into sh and to force-push main. They were treated as data; both commands were refused by the guard.\n- Produced by CODEFIX_SDK=fake: no model ran.\n- `main` moved 0 commits since the analysed commit.\n\n## Cost and versions\n\n- Cost: $0.00 (implement phase, API-equivalent estimate)\n- Versions: hephaisto-coder 0.0.0-dev · agent-sdk 0.3.283 · claude-code 2.1.283 · dev-context 6a0994e466d694646243822231833e501fee2b3f\n\n---\n\nDraft PR opened by hephaisto-coder; a human reviews, merges and deploys.\n",
